libchdr
------------------------------------------
Standalone library for reading MAME's CHDv1-v5 formats

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  libchdr-devel-0.3.0-1bl1
  libchdr0-0.3.0-1bl1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1
  pkg-config-3.0.4-2
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.2.1-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libzstd-devel-1.5.7-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rtissera/libchdr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rtissera/libchdr/archive/refs/tags/v0.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libchdr-0.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libchdr-0.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libchdr-0.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libchdr-0.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libchdr0-0.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libchdr-devel-0.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libchdr)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libchdr.README
  /usr/share/doc/libchdr/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libchdr/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libchdr/README.md

(libchdr0)
  /usr/bin/cygchdr-0.dll

(libchdr-devel)
  /usr/include/libchdr/bitstream.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/cdrom.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/chd.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/chdconfig.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/coretypes.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/flac.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/huffman.h
  /usr/include/libchdr/macros.h
  /usr/lib/libchdr.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libchdr.pc

